{"schemaVersion":1,"articles":[{"id":"monsters.monster.retainer.statblock.time-raider-mind-healer","title":"Рейдер времени-целитель разума","chapter":"24. Помощники","group":"Помощники","path":"Monsters/monster/retainer/statblock/time-raider-mind-healer.md","originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.retainer.statblock/time-raider-mind-healer","originalName":"Time Raider Mind Healer","originalDescription":"|   Humanoid, Time Raider   |         -         |      Level 3      |   Support Retainer    |         EV -         |\n|:-------------------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n|      **1M**<br>Size       |  **5**<br>Speed   | **39**<br>Stamina |  **0**<br>Stability   | **4**<br>Free Strike |\n| **Psychic 5**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |         -         | **-**<br>With Captain |  **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|      **0**<br>Might       | **+2**<br>Agility | **+2**<br>Reason  |  **+2**<br>Intuition  |  **0**<br>Presence   |\n\n> 🏹 **Laser Lancet (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Ranged, Strike, Weapon** |               **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |----------------------------|------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Ranged 3**            | **🎯 One creature or object** |\n>\n> **2d10 + highest characteristic:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 5 fire damage\n> - **12-16:** 8 fire damage\n> - **17+:** 11 fire damage\n>\n> **Effect:** If the mind healer targets an ally, the ability deals no damage. Additionally, the target can end one effect on them that can be ended by a [saving throw](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.general/saving-throw) or that ends at the end of their turn.\n\n> ⭐️ **Foresight**\n>\n> The mind healer doesn't take a bane on strikes against creatures with concealment.","director":{"section":"retainers","sourcePath":"monster/retainer/statblock/time-raider-mind-healer.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"retainer","recordType":"statblock","level":3,"ev":"-","size":"1M","keywords":["Гуманоид","Рейдер времени"],"role":"Поддержка","organization":"Помощник"},"blocks":[{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.retainer.statblock.time-raider-mind-healer"},{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.retainer.advancement-features.time-raider-mind-healer"},{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.retainer.role-advancement.support"}],"related":[{"id":"monsters.monster.retainer.advancement-features.time-raider-mind-healer","title":"Способности развития рейдера времени-целителя разума"},{"id":"monsters.monster.retainer.role-advancement.support","title":"Способности поддержки"},{"id":"monsters.chapter.retainers","title":"Помощники"},{"id":"monsters.guide.retainer-advancement","title":"Таблица развития помощников"}],"originalCoverage":{"status":"complete"}}],"entities":[{"id":"monster.retainer.statblock.time-raider-mind-healer","kind":"retainer","name":"Рейдер времени-целитель разума","markdown":"| Гуманоид, Рейдер времени | - | Уровень 3 | Помощник поддержки | Боевая ценность - |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **1M**<br>Размер | **5**<br>Скорость | **39**<br>Выносливость | **0**<br>Устойчивость | **4**<br>Свободный удар |\n| **Психический 5**<br>Иммунитет | **-**<br>Перемещение | - | **-**<br>С капитаном | **-**<br>Уязвимость |\n| **0**<br>Мощь | **+2**<br>Ловкость | **+2**<br>Разум | **+2**<br>Интуиция | **0**<br>Присутствие |\n\n> 🏹 **Лазерный ланцет (Знаковая способность)**\n>\n> | **Дальний бой, удар, оружие** | **[Основное действие](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.turn)** |\n> |---|---:|\n> | **📏 Дальний бой 3** | **🎯 Одно существо или объект** |\n>\n> **2d10 + высшая характеристика:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 5 урона огнём\n> - **12-16:** 8 урона огнём\n> - **17+:** 11 урона огнём\n>\n> **Эффект:** Если целитель разума выбирает целью союзника, способность не наносит урон. Кроме того, цель может прекратить один действующий на неё эффект, который можно прекратить [спасброском](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.saving-throw) или который заканчивается в конце её хода.\n\n> ⭐️ **Предвидение**\n>\n> Целитель разума не получает помеху на удары по существам с маскировкой.\n","source":{"articleId":"monsters.monster.retainer.statblock.time-raider-mind-healer","path":"Monsters/monster/retainer/statblock/time-raider-mind-healer.md"},"originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.retainer.statblock/time-raider-mind-healer","originalName":"Time Raider Mind Healer","originalDescription":"|   Humanoid, Time Raider   |         -         |      Level 3      |   Support Retainer    |         EV -         |\n|:-------------------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n|      **1M**<br>Size       |  **5**<br>Speed   | **39**<br>Stamina |  **0**<br>Stability   | **4**<br>Free Strike |\n| **Psychic 5**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |         -         | **-**<br>With Captain |  **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|      **0**<br>Might       | **+2**<br>Agility | **+2**<br>Reason  |  **+2**<br>Intuition  |  **0**<br>Presence   |\n\n> 🏹 **Laser Lancet (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Ranged, Strike, Weapon** |               **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |----------------------------|------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Ranged 3**            | **🎯 One creature or object** |\n>\n> **2d10 + highest characteristic:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 5 fire damage\n> - **12-16:** 8 fire damage\n> - **17+:** 11 fire damage\n>\n> **Effect:** If the mind healer targets an ally, the ability deals no damage. Additionally, the target can end one effect on them that can be ended by a [saving throw](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.general/saving-throw) or that ends at the end of their turn.\n\n> ⭐️ **Foresight**\n>\n> The mind healer doesn't take a bane on strikes against creatures with concealment.","director":{"section":"retainers","sourcePath":"monster/retainer/statblock/time-raider-mind-healer.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"retainer","recordType":"